edits. Copilot Enterprise: $39/user/month. Code review now consumes both GitHub Actions minutes and AI Credits.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-06-01-updates-to-github-copilot-billing-and-plans/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"End of an era\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit (r/GithubCopilot)\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"What a joke - GitHub Copilot's new token-based billing spurs consternation among devs\",\n        \"source\": \"TechCrunch\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Users fear they can no longer budget fixed monthly costs and worry about unpredictable bills\",\n        \"source\": \"GitHub Community Forums\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"June 18, 2026: Google Discontinues Gemini CLI for All User Tiers\",\n    \"description\": \"On June 18, 2026, Google shut down Gemini CLI for free, Pro, and Ultra users. The 105,000-star open-source coding tool was replaced with 'Antigravity CLI'. The shutdown caused CI/CD pipeline disruptions and forced developers to migrate to alternatives.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.aibuilderclub.com/blog/google-kills-gemini-cli-june-18-2026\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-06-18\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Happy user of Gemini CLI\",\n        \"source\": \"Hacker News\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Reports of pipelines breaking as the shutdown took effect\",\n        \"source\": \"Community discussions\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Concerns about losing terminal-based AI capabilities\",\n        \"source\": \"Hacker News\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"